{"id":"u-bbfb6a19-c8ff-4c33-94a4-36a134bbf076","src":"community","title":"Ultimate ULUL + Arm Destroyer Program (5 Days)","author":"Vid","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ultimate-ulul-arm-destroyer-program-5-days-24","desc":"Your regular 4 day upper lower split but with a killer arm day (read to the end)\n\nArm day is a bit different, here’s how you do it:\nFor every exercise, start with a failure set with a weight that causes failure at 12 reps.\nThen rest for 15 seconds and try to get in as many reps as possible. The program will tell you how many of these “Effective Reps” you need to get.\nYou can take 15 secs pauses between these ERs, just make sure you hit the number specified.\nExample: For 20 ERs, after a set of 12 reps, you can do something like : 5 reps + 15s rest + 8 reps + 15s rest + 7reps = 20 Effective Reps.\n\nThis was inspired by AthleanX\n\nMonday - Upper 1\nTuesday - Lower 1\nWednesday- Rest (or Cardio if you want)\nThursday - Upper 2\nFriday - Lower 2\nSaturday- Arms\nSunday - Rest (Light Cardio if you want)","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":98,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-06T04:26:21.138Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper 1","Lower 1","Upper 2","Lower 2","Killer Arms Day","Upper 1","Lower 1","Upper 2","Lower 2","Killer Arms Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":9,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":9,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Single Arm Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Back Extension","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Raise (Captain's Chair)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Maintain a 90 degree angle between your wrists + forearms and the ground at the top position to make it more bicep focused. Keep face slightly away from the bar to achieve this"},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"Instead of holding the grip, put your wrist inside the grip to push outward using the back of your wrist to involve your side delts more and less forearms."},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10},{"r":20,"rpe":10}],"note":"One set of 12 reps to failure. \nThen 15 secs rest. \nThen 20 effective reps (you can rest between these 20 reps for 15 seconds if needed)"},{"n":"Skull Crusher","